	<uml:Model xmi:type="uml:Model" name="EA_Model" visibility="public">
		<packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Package" xmi:id="EAPK_FA80C1FF_20BB_45e9_9CD3_9E666418AAAA" name="Murakata Sankrail GIS UML Model" visibility="public">
			<ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_0FF46DBF_16A2_47ec_9E9A_379EDA00FE90" body="Group 08: Ashutosh Sharma (23CS10005), Krishnkant Sahu (23CS10035), Sanskar Sovitkar (24CS10131)&#xA;&#xA;Source: Group 08 Assignment 1 QGIS project of Murakata and Sankrail (nine shapefile layers). Attribute names are the DBF field names. Enumeration values are the category values in each layer's QML style; ConstructionMaterial has no QML style, so its values come from the roads attribute table. The drainage shapefile has 0 features, so Drainage follows its field definition and QML style. The layers share no keys, so no feature-to-feature associations are modelled."/>
